note the form table. Sections: C6.2.6 ADD, C6.2.458 SUB, C6.2.8 ADDS, C6.2.465 SUBS, C6.2.15 AND, C6.2.302 ORR,
note C6.2.156 EOR, C6.2.17 ANDS, C6.2.32 BIC, C6.2.300 ORN (shifted register; 32-bit forms clear bit 31)
